OL,3,AUS interest rates raised for first time
OL,4,Ain three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the announcement, Trump expressed
OL,7,Fsupport for Warsh but said the Fed
OL,8,Fboard, which votes on rate decisions,
OL,9,Fwas "hostile".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
