OL,3,ASnapchat open to putting time limits on
OL,4,Ateens, boss tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of Snapchat-parent Snap Inc
OL,7,Fsays the firm would be "willing to
OL,8,Fimplement" time limits for teens,
OL,9,Ffollowing a call from Meta for it to
OL,10,Ftake action.
OL,12,FEvan Spiegel told the BBC in an
OL,13,Finterview at the company's California
OL,14,Fheadquarters that setting a maximum
OL,15,Famount of time that young users could
OL,16,Fspend on the app could be "an important
OL,17,Fstep forward for the industry."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
